{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Blast Radius</strong>, your mission is simple \u2014 <strong>collect every fruit in the maze and reach the exit without getting caught</strong>. Each level is a trap-filled labyrinth swarming with clever enemies that patrol, chase, and block your path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you\u2019ll need to plan your route, time your moves, and react fast. Grab <strong>special fruits</strong> to temporarily disable enemies, and collect <strong>mushrooms</strong> to rack up extra points. As the levels progress, mazes grow trickier, enemies get smarter, and your timing becomes everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your goal: clear all fruits, avoid capture, and escape each level alive.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Why You'll Love It:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Colorful, polished arcade visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 Fast, skill-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e Smart enemies with unpredictable movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Route-planning and quick decisions are key to survival</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outsmart the maze and collect it all? Get ready to run, dodge, and conquer every level in <strong>Blast Radius</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854520?t=1754555509","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854520?t=1754555509","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854520/7af4dbdd8f8ce53fc07b84286abbefddf13374b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754555509","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854520/7af4dbdd8f8ce53fc07b84286abbefddf13374b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754555509","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharin